   "what": "The KOSPI closed 0.61% lower at 5,342.73 after rising 4.39% on Tuesday and 2.6% on Wednesday. Losers outnumbered winners 595 to 268. Samsung Electronics gained 0.97% to 208,000 won, while SK hynix fell 1.8% to 1.25 million won. Foreign investors bought a net 370.4 billion won of shares. Internet group Naver fell 6.43%.",
